        "content": "LUNG wRATh have chosen to charge straight through an alley to shake the other teams off them!"
    },
    {
        "id": 56,
        "raw": "[name=\"D.D.D.\"]But just as we saw on another stage, our city's crack troops wait in the alleys!",
