        "content": "But just as we saw on another stage, our city's crack troops wait in the alleys!"
    },
    {
        "id": 57,
        "raw": "[name=\"D.D.D.\"]Though I'd love to cover the other teams too, LUNG wRATh has completely captured our attention!",
